    "description": "Hot Wheels Mario Kart Diecast Vehicle Lot\nAssorted Character Karts & Accessories\nModern Era (2019-Present)\nCollection of approximately 30 Hot Wheels 1:64 scale diecast Mario Kart vehicles inspired by the Nintendo video game series. Features a wide cast of characters including Mario, Luigi, Bowser, Peach, Yoshi, Donkey Kong, Toad, and Shy Guy in various kart castings like the Standard Kart, Badwagon, B-Dasher, and Pipe Frame.\nDiecast metal bodies with sculpted driver figures and rolling wheels\nIncludes multiple characters: Mario, Luigi, Bowser, Yoshi, Peach, Toad, and Shy Guy\nIncludes bonus glider wings, parasol attachment, and red warp pipe accessory\nOfficially licensed Mattel Nintendo series compatible with Hot Wheels track\nCondition:\nVehicles show light cosmetic play wear with minor scuffs on painted surfaces. Wheels roll freely on straight axles. Figure sculpts, base plates, and glider attachments are intact and structurally sound.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
